fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstobject.html#gst_object_get_toplevel","fragment":"\n\tgst_object_get_toplevel\n\n\n\tGst.Object.prototype.get_toplevel\n\n\n\tGst.Object.get_toplevel\n\nReturns the toplevel parent of object. This function increases the refcount\nof the toplevel object so you should gst_object_unref it after usage.\nParameters:\na GstObject\ntoplevel of object, or object itself if it has no\nparent. unref after usage.\nMT safe. Grabs and releases object's LOCK.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nReturns the toplevel parent of object. This function increases the refcount\nof the toplevel object so you should Gst.Object.prototype.unref it after usage.\nParameters:\na Gst.Object\ntoplevel of object, or object itself if it has no\nparent. unref after usage.\nMT safe. Grabs and releases object's LOCK.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nReturns the toplevel parent of object. This function increases the refcount\nof the toplevel object so you should Gst.Object.unref it after usage.\nParameters:\na Gst.Object\ntoplevel of object, or object itself if it has no\nparent. unref after usage.\nMT safe. Grabs and releases object's LOCK.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});